{
	# Services (0.6.0, Andrzej: "Continuous payments for some boosts. For example: Hired security service takes out
	# 10% of your rent for a substantial increase in security"). Hired per home on its Services tab, paid every month
	# while hired, cancelled at any time.
	# share: the monthly price as a share of the home's rent at Normal (after the tariff), so it also costs money
	#   while the home stands empty. min: the lowest monthly price.
	# Effects: the same words as house traits and upgrades (comfort, decor, happiness, health, security, wear,
	#   levels, env, kids, events, tags). They count only while the service is hired and never raise the home's value.
	# Special jobs: screening (applicants are half as likely to have bad traits), cleans (graffiti and dirt are cleaned
	#   off every month), repairs (condition added every month, 0.03 is 3%).
	# Where it can go: minTier, maxTier (0 shack to 5 estate), station (true stations only, false planets only).
	"services":[
		{"id":"screening", "name":"Screening service", "share":0.10, "min":100, "screening":true},
